I tend to agree with the wise-guy remark. 
Eventhough it would be extremely convenient for Nethack to have some built-in
"note taking" feature, I don't believe the effort required (by the dev-people)
is worth the "need."

Note Taking Techniques NOW available:
	1) pencil&paper     ---	If this was the ONLY way available, then I
				WOULD agree a new feature would be worthwhile
	2) shell escape (!) ---	Once in the shell, you can call your favorite
				editor. (ie vi,emacs,word,..etc)
 				This is probably the usual/best way.......
	3) xpostit	    ---	For the lucky WorkStaion user.
				(The preffered technique of 4 out of 5 
				 dentists surveyed)

